1
00:00:02,169 --> 00:00:03,795
♪ Dan dan dan ♪

2
00:00:03,921 --> 00:00:04,755
[Back in Time:
From Me to You]

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:08,091
It's for an audition
for the main lead

4
00:00:08,217 --> 00:00:09,426
The main lead?

5
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:10,844
Me?

6
00:00:10,969 --> 00:00:12,684
Their lead actor
suddenly left

7
00:00:12,768 --> 00:00:14,765
so they're urgently
looking for a new one

8
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,934
It's just a replacement

9
00:00:17,059 --> 00:00:19,811
but still, it's a great
opportunity for us

10
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,166
Of course it is!

11
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,690
I'm gonna
give my all to this

12
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:27,527
Do you know
Choi Hyobum?

13
00:00:27,653 --> 00:00:30,030
Choi Hyobum?

14
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:34,076
He's a formal member in
Shin Yoo-il's idol group

15
00:00:34,201 --> 00:00:35,601
He'll be your opposite
in this drama

16
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:39,355
[Back in Time:
From Me to You]

17
00:00:39,439 --> 00:00:40,922
[Audition script]

18
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,543
Gosh, I'm nervous

19
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,088
No, relax, Hyesung

20
00:00:46,213 --> 00:00:48,674
This is an opportunity
I've never dreamed of

21
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:50,217
I should be grateful

22
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,722
[Shindecent]

23
00:01:00,519 --> 00:01:01,311
Hello?

24
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:02,896
What took you so long?

25
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:05,065
I don't wanna work
on my day off

26
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:07,359
Why are you so cold
all of a sudden?

27
00:01:07,484 --> 00:01:08,986
Hang up if you have
nothing to say

28
00:01:09,111 --> 00:01:10,591
You're auditioning
for a drama, right?

29
00:01:11,989 --> 00:01:13,448
How did you know that?

30
00:01:13,573 --> 00:01:14,366
I'll help you today

31
00:01:14,491 --> 00:01:15,491
I'm off today

32
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:18,328
No thanks

33
00:01:19,913 --> 00:01:20,998
I don't need your help

34
00:01:26,586 --> 00:01:27,713
What the heck…

35
00:01:29,506 --> 00:01:31,133
Help me? With what?
